  },
  {
   "chain_alternation": 6,
   "chain_mismatch": 0,
   "chain_pointer": 6,
   "grade": "good",
   "messages": [
    {
     "body": "（把一袋新米往阿禾手里塞）拿着，自家田里的，不图啥，就图个踏实。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 0,
     "from": "P001",
     "hearer": "阿禾",
     "msg_uid": "42:629",
     "place": "market",
     "reply_to": null,
     "round": 6,
     "seq": 629,
     "slot": "evening",
     "speaker": "老周",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（推了推袋子）老周，这……你家也不宽裕，我拿回去心里不踏实。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 0,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:794",
     "place": "plaza",
     "reply_to": "42:629",
     "round": 7,
     "seq": 794,
     "slot": "evening",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    },
    {
     "body": "（把袋子又推回去）拿着吧，自家地里长的，不值钱。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 0,
     "from": "P001",
     "hearer": "阿禾",
     "msg_uid": "42:929",
     "place": "residence",
     "reply_to": "42:794",
     "round": 9,
     "seq": 929,
     "slot": "night",
     "speaker": "老周",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（搓了搓手）那……我收下了。回头给你送点新磨的玉米面。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 0,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:1393",
     "place": "residence",
     "reply_to": "42:929",
     "round": 10,
     "seq": 1393,
     "slot": "night",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    },
    {
     "body": "（摆摆手）不用不用，自家地里长的，不值钱。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 1,
     "from": "P001",
     "hearer": "阿禾",
     "msg_uid": "42:1698",
     "place": "park",
     "reply_to": "42:1393",
     "round": 12,
     "seq": 1698,
     "slot": "morning",
     "speaker": "老周",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P003"
    },
    {
     "body": "（搓了搓手）那……那我拿点鸡蛋换？家里鸡刚下的。",
     "channel": "dm",
     "day": 1,
     "from": "P003",
     "hearer": "老周",
     "msg_uid": "42:1890",
     "place": "farm",
     "reply_to": "42:1698",
     "round": 13,
     "seq": 1890,
     "slot": "morning",
     "speaker": "阿禾",
     "tags": [
      "gift"
     ],
     "to": "P001"
    }
